      <Placemark>
        <description>Part of the National Aquarium at Baltimore.  The dolphin show is spectacular and for most (kids especially) it&apos;s the highlight of the visit.  See the comment in the placemark for the aquarium about ticket lines and planning ahead for your visit.</description>
