      <Placemark>
        <description>http://www.mdsci.org/

The other big family oriented attraction in the Inner Harbor area along with the National Aquarium.  Plan on spending at least a couple of hours (more likely half a day) seeing the exhibits, science shows, and perhaps catching an IMAX film.  Lots of hands on activities as well.  There is plenty to enjoy for adults and kids of all ages.  I took a 4, 6, and 8 year old and after three hours, I still had to drag each one of them out.  And this was before the renovation was completed in 2004.</description>
        <name>Maryland Science Center</name>
        <View>
          <longitude>-76.61149196517023</longitude>
          <latitude>39.28150688346345</latitude>
          <range>331.2029992244241</range>
