        <Placemark>
          <description>A little bit of a hike up from the Inner Harbor, but a very nice panoramic view of the entire harbor area.  A nice place to go to get away from the tourists and visitors in the harbor area.  The park has a fenced in area (to insure a kid friendly area free of land mines left by neighborhood dogs) with playground equipment for the kids to burn off any energy they have left after climbing the hill.  A nice place to bring a take-out lunch in pretty weather if you&apos;re looking to get away from the crowds down below (see comments under Federal Hill neighborhood placemark).</description>
          <name>Federal Hill Park</name>
